        "order": 1,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-01\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-01\"><h2>〔Ⅰ〕 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>〔Ⅰ〕 解答</h3><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>〔Ⅰ〕</dt><dd>(1) 〔4〕／(2) 〔3〕／(3) 〔3〕／(4) 〔2〕／(5) 〔2〕／(6) 〔1〕／(7) 〔2〕／(8) 〔4〕／(9) 〔2〕／(10) 〔3〕</dd></div></dl></section></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説《風や反射板がある場合のドップラー効果》</h3><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>学習の入口</strong><p>音源・風・反射板のそれぞれについて、まず「波長を決める側」と「波を受け取る側」を分けます。距離÷波数で波長を出し、音速÷波長で観測振動数を求める順序を守ると式を混同しにくくなります。</p></aside></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(2)</h3><p class=\"prose\">音波は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"Vt-v_\\mathrm{S}t\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の距離に <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"ft\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 個はいっている。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{Vt-v_\\mathrm{S}t}{ft}=\\frac{V-v_\\mathrm{S}}{f}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(3)</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{V}{\\left(\\dfrac{V-v_\\mathrm{S}}{f}\\right)}=\\frac{V}{V-v_\\mathrm{S}}f\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(4)</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{V}{V-v_\\mathrm{S}}f&gt;f\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> である。</p></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(6)</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8d8feaf7780d\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(6)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{(V+w)t-v_\\mathrm{S}t}{ft}=\\frac{V+w-v_\\mathrm{S}}{f}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(7)</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cd8734e4d42e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(7)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{V+w}{\\left(\\dfrac{V+w-v_\\mathrm{S}}{f}\\right)}=\\frac{V+w}{V+w-v_\\mathrm{S}}f\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(8)</h3><p class=\"prose\">音源から出る音の波長 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\lambda\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-241ce7ecc46a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(8)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\lambda=\\frac{V}{f}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">音源から反射板へ向かう見かけの音速は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V+v_\\mathrm{R}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> になる。よって、求める振動数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-241ce7ecc46a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(8)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"f&#39;=\\frac{V+v_\\mathrm{R}}{\\lambda}=\\frac{V+v_\\mathrm{R}}{V}f\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(9)</h3><p class=\"prose\">求める振動数を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f&#39;&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく。反射板が音源となり、速さ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_\\mathrm{R}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> で観測者に近づくので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-7a7170fab8cc\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(9)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"f&#39;&#39;=\\frac{V}{V-v_\\mathrm{R}}f&#39;=\\frac{V+v_\\mathrm{R}}{V-v_\\mathrm{R}}f\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(10)</h3><p class=\"prose\">音源から直接届く音の振動数は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> のままなので、1秒間のうなりの回数は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-6c2d89f668f6\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(10)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"f&#39;&#39;-f=\\frac{2v_\\mathrm{R}}{V-v_\\mathrm{R}}f\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\">よって、うなりの周期は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-6c2d89f668f6\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(10)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{1}{f}=\\frac{V-v_\\mathrm{R}}{2v_\\mathrm{R}f}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-02",
        "label": "〔Ⅱ〕",
        "order": 2,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-02\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-02\"><h2>〔Ⅱ〕 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>〔Ⅱ〕 解答</h3><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>〔Ⅱ〕</dt><dd>(1) 〔1〕／(2) 〔1〕／(3) 〔4〕／(4) 〔3〕／(5) 〔3〕／(6) 〔4〕／(7) 〔4〕／(8) 〔2〕／(9) 〔4〕／(10) 〔1〕／(11) 〔2〕</dd></div></dl></section></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説《傾いたレール上を運動する導体棒による誘導起電力》</h3><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>学習の入口</strong><p>最初はオームの法則と磁場中の電流が受ける力で静止条件を作ります。棒が動き始めた後は、磁束変化→誘導起電力→電流→磁力の順に量をつなぎ、終端速度では再び力のつり合いへ戻ります。</p></aside></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(2)</h3><p class=\"prose\">(1)の電流を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"I_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"I_0BL=\\frac{EBL}{R}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(3)</h3><p class=\"prose\">ab 側から見た導体棒にはたらく力を右に図示する。導体棒にはたらく力のレールに平行な方向のつり合いより</p><figure class=\"batch-figure-pending\" data-figure-placeholder=\"true\" data-figure-id=\"ans2-force-balance\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ab側から見た導体棒にはたらく力の図。傾いたレール上の導体棒に磁場から受ける力I0BLと重力mg、鉛直上向きの磁束密度B、水平線となす角θを示す（図版準備中）\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.441\"><strong>図版準備中</strong><p>ab側から見た導体棒にはたらく力の図。傾いたレール上の導体棒に磁場から受ける力I0BLと重力mg、鉛直上向きの磁束密度B、水平線となす角θを示す</p></div><figcaption>図の位置・大きさを確保しています。図を使う説明は確認完了までレビュー中です。</figcaption></figure><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"mg\\sin\\theta=\\frac{EBL}{R}\\cos\\theta\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\therefore\\ E=\\frac{mgR\\tan\\theta}{BL}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(4)</h3><p class=\"prose\">導体棒は水平面に対して <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v\\cos\\theta\\cdot\\Delta t\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> だけ移動する。求める磁束変化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\Delta\\Phi\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> は</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cbe3b52ccdb4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\Delta\\Phi=BLv\\Delta t\\cos\\theta\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(5)</h3><p class=\"prose\">求める誘導起電力の大きさを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく。ファラデーの電磁誘導の法則より</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V=\\frac{\\Delta\\Phi}{\\Delta t}=BLv\\cos\\theta\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(6)</h3><p class=\"prose\">求める電流の強さを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"I_1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8d8feaf7780d\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(6)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"I_1=\\frac{E_1-V}{R}=\\frac{E_1-BLv\\cos\\theta}{R}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(7)</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cd8734e4d42e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(7)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"I_1BL=\\frac{E_1-BLv\\cos\\theta}{R}BL\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(8)</h3><p class=\"prose\">求める電流の強さを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"I_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく。力のつり合いより</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-241ce7ecc46a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(8)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"mg\\sin\\theta=I_2BL\\cos\\theta\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-241ce7ecc46a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(8)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\therefore\\ I_2=\\frac{mg\\tan\\theta}{BL}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(9)</h3><p class=\"prose\">求める速さを <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_m\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく。(6)と(8)を利用して</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-7a7170fab8cc\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(9)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\frac{mg\\tan\\theta}{BL}=\\frac{E_1-BLv_m\\cos\\theta}{R}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-7a7170fab8cc\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(9)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"\\therefore\\ v_m=\\frac{E_1BL-mgR\\tan\\theta}{B^{2}L^{2}\\cos\\theta}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(10)</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-6c2d89f668f6\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(10)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"E_1I_2=\\frac{E_1mg\\tan\\theta}{BL}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(11)</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-2471833ad37c\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(11)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"RI_2{}^{2}=R\\left(\\frac{mg\\tan\\theta}{BL}\\right)^{2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section></div></article>"
      },
      {
        "id": "major-question-03",
        "label": "〔Ⅲ〕",
        "order": 3,
        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card answer-major-card\" id=\"major-question-03\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-03\"><h2>〔Ⅲ〕 解答・解説</h2><div class=\"answer-explanation\"><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>〔Ⅲ〕 解答</h3><section class=\"answer-key-panel\"><h3>解答</h3><dl class=\"batch-answer-key\"><div><dt>(1)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{2v_0}{g}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(2)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{2v_0{}^{2}}{g}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(3)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>成分の大きさ：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>成分の大きさ：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2v_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(4)</dt><dd>斜面に平行な成分の大きさ：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}v_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、斜面に垂直な成分の大きさ：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}v_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(5)</dt><dd>斜面に平行な成分の大きさ：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}v_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、斜面に垂直な成分の大きさ：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}ev_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(6)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>成分の大きさ：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{3+e}{2}v_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>成分の大きさ：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{3-e}{2}v_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(7)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{2ev_0}{g}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div><div><dt>(8)</dt><dd><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{(2+3e+e^{2})v_0{}^{2}}{g}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span></dd></div></dl></section></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>解説《水平投射した小球の傾斜45°の斜面への衝突》</h3><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>学習の入口</strong><p>床を離れた後は水平投射としてx方向とy方向を分けます。斜面衝突では速度を斜面平行・垂直成分へ変換し、垂直成分だけにはねかえり係数を適用してから再びx・y成分へ戻します。</p></aside></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(1)</h3><p class=\"prose\">求める時刻を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t_1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、1回目に衝突する <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 座標と <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 座標をそれぞれ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x_1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y_1\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x_1=v_0t_1\\qquad y_1=\\frac{1}{2}gt_1{}^{2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"45^\\circ\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の斜面なので衝突点の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 座標と <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 座標は値が等しい。ここで <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t_1\\neq0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> なので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-fd0ad9026eee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(1)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"t_1=\\frac{2v_0}{g}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(2)</h3><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-0e77e68ba547\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(2)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x_1=v_0t_1=\\frac{2v_0{}^{2}}{g}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(3)</h3><p class=\"prose\">求める <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 成分の大きさと <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 成分の大きさをそれぞれ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_y\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-46f789d1efee\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(3)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v_x=v_0,\\quad v_y=gt_1=2v_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(4)</h3><p class=\"prose\">求める斜面に平行な成分の大きさと斜面に垂直な成分の大きさをそれぞれ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V_X\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V_Y\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cbe3b52ccdb4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V_X=v_x\\cos45^\\circ+v_y\\sin45^\\circ=\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}v_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cbe3b52ccdb4\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(4)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V_Y=-v_x\\sin45^\\circ+v_y\\cos45^\\circ=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}v_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(5)</h3><p class=\"prose\">求める斜面に平行な成分の大きさと斜面に垂直な成分の大きさをそれぞれ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V_X{}&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V_Y{}&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V_X{}&#39;=V_X=\\frac{3\\sqrt{2}}{2}v_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-97ce6126f9ba\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(5)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"V_Y{}&#39;=eV_Y=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}ev_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(6)</h3><p class=\"prose\">求める <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 成分の大きさと <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 成分の大きさをそれぞれ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_x{}&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_y{}&#39;\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8d8feaf7780d\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(6)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v_x{}&#39;=V_X{}&#39;\\cos45^\\circ+V_Y{}&#39;\\sin45^\\circ=\\frac{3+e}{2}v_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-8d8feaf7780d\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(6)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"v_y{}&#39;=V_X{}&#39;\\sin45^\\circ-V_Y{}&#39;\\cos45^\\circ=\\frac{3-e}{2}v_0\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(7)</h3><p class=\"prose\">求める時間を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、2回目に衝突する <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 座標と <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 座標をそれぞれ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y_2\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> とおく。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cd8734e4d42e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(7)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x_2=x_1+v_x{}&#39;t_2\\quad\\cdots\\cdots\\text{①}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cd8734e4d42e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(7)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"y_2=y_1+v_y{}&#39;t_2+\\frac{1}{2}gt_2{}^{2}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"45^\\circ\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> の斜面なので衝突点の <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 座標と <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> 座標は値が等しい。ここで <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"t_2\\neq0\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> なので</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-cd8734e4d42e\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(7)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"t_2=\\frac{2ev_0}{g}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div></section><section class=\"answer-explanation-section\"><h3>(8)</h3><p class=\"prose\">①式を使って計算する。</p><div class=\"formula answer-formula\" data-formula-purpose=\"source-goal-241ce7ecc46a\"><span class=\"answer-formula__purpose\">(8)</span><div class=\"answer-formula__math\" data-katex=\"x_2=x_1+v_x&#39; t_2=\\frac{2v_0^2}{g}+\\frac{3+e}{2}v_0\\cdot\\frac{2ev_0}{g}=\\frac{(2+3e+e^2)v_0^2}{g}\" data-display-mode=\"true\"></div></div><aside class=\"source-note answer-note\"><strong>結論</strong><p>したがって、2回目に衝突する位置のx座標は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"\\dfrac{(2+3e+e^2)v_0^2}{g}\" data-display-mode=\"false\"></span> です。</p></aside></section></div></article>"
      }
    ]
  },
